# Physics2D is a native Objo port of the Box2D 3.1.1 rigid-body physics engine.
# The module constants below carry the release version so applications and
# support diagnostics can report which build they run against. The full
# compatibility record (minimum Objo Studio version and required engine
# features) lives in the generated distribution header and docs/PORTING.md.
Module Physics2D
## Semantic version of this Physics2D module, following SemVer 2.0.0.
## The suffix `-rc.N` marks a release candidate; dropping the suffix is the
## release act. This is a plain constant: the module has no package manager,
## so the version travels with the source you install.
Const VERSION As String = "1.0.0-rc.1"
End Module
